          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Offerings</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfbfd;--muted:#667085;--accent:#6b8e7e;--soft:#eef6f1;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#0f1724;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f7faf8);}\\n    .frame{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(107,142,126,0.06),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\\n    header nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    header .brand{font-weight:700;color:#0b1220}\\n    main{flex:1;padding:40px 20px;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;width:100%}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:34px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,142,126,0.04),rgba(107,142,126,0.02));box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(12,20,24,0.04)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#072029;line-height:1.05}\\n    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta-row{margin-top:12px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5f866f);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .soft-card{margin-top:22px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--soft);color:#062023}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .service{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:white;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(9,18,22,0.04);min-height:120px}\\n    .service h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    footer{padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* subtle SVG pattern placed behind content */\\n    svg.bg{position:fixed;right:-120px;top:-80px;width:680px;height:680px;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none;z-index:-1}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .qa{padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,white,rgba(255,255,255,0.95));border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .case{margin-top:16px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(107,142,126,0.03),transparent)}\\n    @media(min-width:760px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 320px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='frame'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div class='brand'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>\\n        <a href='conditions.html'>Concerns</a>\\n        <a href='approach.html'>Process</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Reach</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <svg class='bg' viewBox='0 0 600 600' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n          <stop offset='0' stop-color='%236b8e7e' stop-opacity='0.85'/>\\n          <stop offset='1' stop-color='%23a3c7b7' stop-opacity='0.4'/>\\n        </linearGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect x='0' y='0' width='600' height='600' fill='url(%23g1)' rx='40'/>\\n      <g fill='%23fbfbfd' opacity='0.08'>\\n        <circle cx='120' cy='80' r='90'/>\\n        <circle cx='480' cy='380' r='120'/>\\n        <circle cx='360' cy='140' r='60'/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class='hero'>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>A calm container for whole-person care — clear, practical, human.</h1>\\n          <p class='muted'>Workshops, individual plans, and ongoing support that bring physiology, lifestyle, and gentle therapies into one plan. Education first; partnership always.</p>\\n          <div class='cta-row'>\\n            <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='soft-card'>\\n          <strong>Signature series</strong>\\n          <p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>A short events series blending group learning with individual check-ins — ideal for busy lives seeking lasting shifts.</p>\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n            <a class='btn' href='book.html'>Reserve a seat</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class='pillars' aria-labelledby='pillars-heading'>\\n        <h2 id='pillars-heading' style='margin:0;font-size:18px'>What we offer — pillars of care</h2>\\n        <div class='grid' style='margin-top:8px'>\\n          <div class='service'>\\n            <h3>Integrative Consults</h3>\\n            <div class='muted'>A thoughtful intake, systems review, and personalized plan that blends nutrition, gentle botanicals, and lifestyle strategies.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='service'>\\n            <h3>Event Series & Workshops</h3>\\n            <div class='muted'>Small cohorts focused on sleep, stress resilience, and mindful nutrition — includes guided practices and take-home tools.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='service'>\\n            <h3>Follow-up Care</h3>\\n            <div class='muted'>Ongoing check-ins to refine plans, assess progress, and adapt recommendations to your life rhythm.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='service'>\\n            <h3>Telehealth & Group Options</h3>\\n            <div class='muted'>Remote visits and community sessions designed for accessibility and sustained learning.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class='case'>\\n        <h3 style='margin:0'>Case notes — a typical starter</h3>\\n        <p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>A first visit includes a systems timeline, pragmatic priorities, and a focused action plan. Labs may be discussed as educational tools; they are optional and explained if suggested.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class='faq'>\\n        <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Quick questions</h4>\\n        <div class='qa'>\\n          <strong>Do you promise cures?</strong>\\n          <div class='muted'>We do not promise cures. Our work is educational and collaborative: we aim to support the body's balance through informed, whole-person strategies.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='qa'>\\n          <strong>Are herbs and supplements used?</strong>\\n          <div class='muted'>When appropriate and safe, botanicals and nutrients are suggested. All recommendations consider interactions and personal context.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style='margin-top:22px;text-align:center'>\\n        <p class='note'>To book a consultation or learn about the next event in the series, reach out.</p>\\n        <div style='margin-top:10px'>\\n          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Start with a visit</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Common Concerns</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffdfa;--ink:#072029;--muted:#536170;--accent:#8aa99a}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto;color:var(--ink);background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%,rgba(138,169,154,0.06),transparent),var(--bg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:920px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    header a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    h1{margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:24px}\\n    .intro{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(6,15,20,0.04)}\\n    .card h3{margin:0 0 6px 0}\\n    .disclaimer{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .svg-side{position:fixed;left:-140px;bottom:-100px;opacity:0.08;width:500px;height:500px;pointer-events:none}\\n    .faq{margin-top:16px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px;text-align:center}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6b8b76);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    @media(min-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class='svg-side' viewBox='0 0 500 500' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id='bg2' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n        <stop offset='0' stop-color='%23a9c8b4'/> <stop offset='1' stop-color='%238aa99a'/> \\n      </linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width='500' height='500' rx='80' fill='url(%23bg2)' />\\n    <g fill='%23fff' opacity='0.06'>\\n      <circle cx='120' cy='120' r='90'/>\\n      <circle cx='380' cy='320' r='100'/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Back to welcome</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='services.html'>Services</a>\\n        <a href='approach.html'>How I work</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <h1>Common concerns people bring</h1>\\n    <p class='intro'>We listen to patterns, not just symptoms. Below are frequent starting themes — each approached through education, lifestyle adjustments, and gentle therapies where appropriate.</p>\\n\\n    <section class='grid' aria-label='conditions list'>\\n      <article class='card'>\\n        <h3>Stress & Emotion Regulation</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>Practical nervous-system tools, breath work, adaptative routines, and sleep hygiene to support resilience rather than quick fixes.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class='card'>\\n        <h3>Disordered or Poor Sleep</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>We explore routines, environment, nutrition timing, and gentle circadian supports. Tailored plans help rewire habits over weeks.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class='card'>\\n        <h3>Digestive Upset & Bloating</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>Patterns, food habits, and gut-support strategies are reviewed. Labs may be discussed as educational tools but are optional and explained clearly.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class='card'>\\n        <h3>Chronic Low Energy</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>Sleep, nutrient status, gentle movement, and stress-response are evaluated with stepwise plans to restore sustainable energy.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class='card'>\\n        <h3>Systemic Inflammation & Pain</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>Anti-inflammatory lifestyle patterns, targeted nutrition, and safe adjunctive therapies are discussed to reduce burden and improve function.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <p class='disclaimer'>Note: these descriptions are educational and not promises of cure. For urgent or emergent concerns, please seek immediate medical attention. Any lab, supplement, or prescription suggestion will be discussed transparently and tailored to your context.</p>\\n\\n    <section class='faq'>\\n      <h4 style='margin:12px 0 8px 0'>A brief FAQ</h4>\\n      <div class='card'>\\n        <strong>Will I need lots of tests?</strong>\\n        <p class='muted'>Not always. Tests are optional tools used when they will change care. We prioritize practical steps you can try first.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='card' style='margin-top:10px'>\\n        <strong>Is this safe with my current medications?</strong>\\n        <p class='muted'>Safety is central. We review interactions and coordinate with your prescribers when needed.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class='cta'>\\n      <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Schedule a short consult</a>\\n      <p style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>Phone: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a></p>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Approach</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfcfb;--ink:#082128;--muted:#5b6b72;--accent:#6e9b86}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfcfb,#f3f6f4)}\\n    .shell{max-width:900px;margin:20px auto;padding:22px}\\n    .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    h1{font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;margin:10px 0}\\n    .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .step{background:white;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(15,23,28,0.04)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .mini{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .svg-mark{position:fixed;right:10px;top:110px;opacity:0.08;width:360px;height:360px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px;text-align:center}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5d8b79);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    @media(min-width:720px){.flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class='svg-mark' viewBox='0 0 360 360' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id='ax' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n        <stop offset='0' stop-color='%236b8e7e'/> <stop offset='1' stop-color='%23cfe4db'/> \\n      </linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width='360' height='360' rx='48' fill='url(%23ax)' />\\n    <g fill='%23fff' opacity='0.06'>\\n      <circle cx='60' cy='60' r='50'/>\\n      <circle cx='300' cy='260' r='70'/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class='shell'>\\n    <div class='top'>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n        <div class='mini'>Practitioner, educator, collaborator</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Welcome</a>\\n        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>\\n        <a href='conditions.html'>Concerns</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <h1>A gentle structure: intake, plan, follow-up</h1>\\n    <p class='muted'>Our model values clarity and small experiments. Below is how the work typically unfolds — an educational path, not a promise.</p>\\n\\n    <section class='flow' aria-label='care flow'>\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <h3>1. Guided Intake</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>A whole-life conversation: timeline of health, priorities, and practical constraints. We identify what matters most and set near-term aims.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <h3>2. A pragmatic plan</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>A focused set of actions — sleep adjustments, targeted nutrition, movement, and stress-support practices. Suggestions are educational and personalized.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <h3>3. Optional labs (educational)</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>When a test will change options, we discuss it plainly: costs, interpretation, and how results would shape the plan. Tests are optional and never mandatory.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <h3>4. Follow-up & refinement</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>Short, focused check-ins to adjust steps, troubleshoot barriers, and build durable routines. Progress is measured in small wins.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <h3>5. Community learning</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>Group series and workshops extend education and offer peer support — ideal for skill-building and shared practice.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <h3>6. When to bring other clinicians</h3>\\n        <p class='muted'>We collaborate with specialists when needed and coordinate care. Integration, not replacement, is the goal.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Myth vs. truth</h4>\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <strong>Myth:</strong> Holistic means slow and vague.\\n        <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Truth: Holistic care can be targeted, measurable, and practical — education and partnership accelerate meaningful change.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='case' style='margin-top:16px'>\\n      <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>A short case note</h4>\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <p class='muted' style='margin:0'>A patient arrives with tiredness and fragmentary sleep. We prioritize sleep timing, one dietary tweak, and two nightly rituals. After three check-ins small gains translate into restored energy and clearer day rhythms.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='faq' style='margin-top:16px'>\\n      <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Questions I often hear</h4>\\n      <div class='step'>\\n        <strong>How fast will I feel different?</strong>\\n        <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>It varies. Some shifts are immediate (sleep hygiene changes), others take weeks. The plan is paced to fit real life.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='step' style='margin-top:8px'>\\n        <strong>Do you prescribe medications?</strong>\\n        <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>When appropriate, medications are discussed and coordinated with prescribing clinicians. Our focus is to expand options thoughtfully.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class='cta'>\\n      <p class='mini'>If this approach resonates, let's set a short first visit to clarify your priorities.</p>\\n      <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Book an introductory session</a>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer style='margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center'>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{PHONE}} • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
